    "pf-7bcdec1a": {
      "type": "pf-7bcdec1a",
      "settings": {
        "pf_07756a66_value": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our User Guide for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X. We also offer live customer support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com",
        "pf_447adeab_value": "<strong>For computers (Mac or PC):</strong> ThePhotoStick Omni X does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br><strong>For phones (Android or iOS):</strong> ThePhotoStick Omni X offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.<br><br>There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and follow the on-screen instructions to easily get started. ",
        "pf_bad888a1_value": "<strong></strong>We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick, our team is here to assist you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please get in touch with us&nbsp;at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our Returns and Refunds page.   ",
        "pf_86cc8d18_value": "ThePhotoStick Omni X works with all modern computers, smartphones, and tablets right out of the box.<br><br>It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and Later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and Later<br><br>For more up-to-date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our System Requirements page. ",
        "pf_8e0c3194_value": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick Omni X:<br><br>32GB - 12,800 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br>256GB - 102,400 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni X, check out our Official User Guide.</em> ",
        "pf_4a1c8711_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(237, 214, 9);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(223, 201, 7);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 221, 11);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 207, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span></span></span></span></span></span> Rated 5 Stars by 6,000+ Customers",
        "pf_b6bf013f_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(237, 214, 9);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(223, 201, 7);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 221, 11);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 207, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span></span></span></span></span></span> Rated 5 Stars by 6,000+ Customers",
        "pf_cf5aee99_value": "I bought this after my friend lost all her photos when her phone broke, and I didn’t want that to happen to me. Setup was easy, and it quickly found years’ worth of photos I didn’t even realize I still had. Now I feel like everything important is finally protected.",
        "pf_cc11980a_value": "Absolutely love the fact that the instructions were easy to follow &amp; I was backing up my phone files in no time at all. It works so fast too &amp; is such a convenient, time saving device. Fantastic service &amp; prompt delivery. Many thanks!&nbsp; —Helen P.",
        "pf_bce5fdbc_value": "I had thousands of photos scattered across my phone, laptop, and old tablet, and I kept putting off organizing them. Thephotostick Omni made it ridiculously easy. I plugged it in, followed the prompts, and it found everything for me. Huge peace of mind.",
        "pf_3f00fc7d_value": "<strong></strong>Of course! Visit our website, thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST ",
        "pf_074ec300_value": "We are so confident you will love ThePhotoStick® Omni&nbsp;that we offer a no-risk 30-Day Money Back Guarantee!&nbsp;If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase, our team is happy to help you with an easy, hassle-free return.<br>",
        "pf_a558319b_value": "I’ve been paying for cloud storage for years and was tired of the monthly fees. This felt like a smarter investment. Now I have all my photos and videos safely backed up on one USB that I can use anytime. Highly recommend!",
        "pf_b5aa8367_value": "But sadly, most people don’t have the time or expertise to backup their files. This means your priceless family photos and videos are at risk of being lost suddenly, with no chance of recovery.",
        "pf_b8d30bbc_value": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people use ThePhotoStick Omni X&nbsp;for&nbsp;weekly backups to make sure they are continually protecting their memories. ",
        "pf_aa4d718b_value": "Open the&nbsp;app on your phone/tablet, or use it on your computer. Either way, Thephotostick Omni X is perfect for backing up my&nbsp;photos.",
        "pf_b502a4c0_value": "<b><em>NEW!&nbsp;</em>ThePhotoStick® Omni X</b>&nbsp;automatically finds and protects thousands of photos and videos across all your devices.",
        "pf_0789b306_value": "Plug it in and watch ThePhotoStick Omni scan, sort, and secure every photo and video before accidents, crashes, or deletions strike.",
        "pf_b7a107b1_value": " Connect to iPhones, Androids, laptops, and tablets for saving and sharing—no extra apps or compatibility worries.",
        "pf_b11a69f6_value": "We understand that once you've purchased, you want it ASAP. That's why we promise speedy shipping to your door.",
        "pf_034dcb2f_value": "<strong>🔥&nbsp;Sale:</strong> Live for 24 hrs&nbsp; |&nbsp; ⏰&nbsp;<strong>Stock:</strong>  LOW Inventory",
        "pf_30c2a257_value": "Select 'BACK&nbsp;UP FILES NOW' and that's it! ThePhotoStick® Omni X will do the hard work for you.&nbsp;",
        "pf_4821442e_value": "We provide a seamless SSL encrypted checkout to ensure your shopping experience is smooth and worry-free.",
        "pf_5da88532_value": " ThePhotoStick Omni automatically finds, organizes, and backs up all your files while you sip coffee.",
        "pf_6de48085_value": "No technical knowledge needed. If you can plug in a USB stick, you can use ThePhotoStick® Omni X!",
        "pf_fc6da70f_value": "1.5 Million+ People Trust<br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\">ThePhotoStick®&nbsp;</span>",
        "pf_a3dc579d_value": " Frees up gigabytes in minutes so your phone runs fast and never says “storage full” again.",
        "pf_d9363194_value": "<strong>65% of people</strong> (or their family members) have lost photos or videos due to:",
